  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Minimalist Themes",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\nDSH Minimalist Themes is a collection of warm-color themes for Deepseek Harness, designed with a minimalist aesthetic."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Minimalist Themes",
      "text": "From the main screen, select **Plugins**. On the Plugins page, select **DSH Minimalist Themes** to open its detail page, then use the theme picker to choose a palette. Select a swatch to apply it; choose the reset option to return to the built-in theme preference. The app-wide Light, Dark, or System setting is separate and remains under **Settings → General → Appearance**."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Minimalist Themes",
      "text": "[](LICENSE) [](https://github.com/mykeura/dsh-minimalist-themes) [](https://www.typescriptlang.org) [](https://react.dev) [](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript) [](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)\n\n---\n\nThe plugin targets the DSH web profile. It was checked against the local Deepseek Harness client build metadata `0.2.2-alpha.3`; this identifies the local repository/build metadata and does not independently verify a separately installed application binary."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web add github:mykeura/dsh-minimalist-themes"
    },
    {
      "section": "pin a version:",
      "text": "pnpm dsh plugin --profile web add github:mykeura/dsh-minimalist-themes#v1.1.1\n```\n\nOnce the plugin is installed, open **Plugins** from the main screen and select **DSH Minimalist Themes** to access its theme picker."
    },
